{"crw-nogi-11592":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"                  Hello"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近なかなか眠いでごわす"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/20/1850758/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(生駒ちゃん！今日もイケメンねっ♪)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てかね、最近よく歩いてたら気づかれるようになったんですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/20/1850758/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イェイ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/20/1850758/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達と学校帰り遊びに行ったときにも気づかれたのっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/20/1850758/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校帰りは良く気づいてくれる方が多いなぁ..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/20/1850758/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ学校でも気づいてくれたり......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/20/1850758/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもその時クラスの人と面白い動画や写真を撮ったりして遊んでたから変なとこ見られたなぁ......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/20/1850758/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁでも知ってくださってる方がいるのはなんだか嬉しいですねぇ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/20/1850758/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"blogのコメントにもたまに、見かけたよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/20/1850758/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っとか言ってくださってて......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/20/1850758/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/20/1850758/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/20/1850758/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントでビックリしたことがあって\n飛行機の機内プログラム？\nに乃木坂の『君の名は希望』流れてたみたいで......凄いこれまたビックリ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/20/1850758/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/20/1850758/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/20/1850758/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントで、まあやの体調を気にしてくれたり、応援してくれてて、本当にありがとうございます♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/20/1850758/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄くパワーになります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/20/1850758/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆も元気で毎日過ごせてますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/20/1850758/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして全握は癒し系マイマイです\n私も大好き！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/20/1850758/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイマイfamilyの皆さん宜しくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/20/1850758/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めましての方、お久し振りの方、もう顔覚えちゃったよ♪の方（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみに待ってます〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※今は、控え室で高山かずみんと若月のゆみさんとキャプテンの桜井れいかたんと美雲ちゃん、みなみといるよー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/20/1850758/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE "},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/04/20/1850758/0011.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-2275":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は大晦日ですね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は今、年賀状をせっせと書いてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなっちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/icon/sweat01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"　急げ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年１年を漢字で表すと　「坂」です。　"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大変なことや戸惑うこともあったけど、坂を上るように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一歩一歩、とにかく一生懸命進んできました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/icon/up.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その坂の上には何があるのかな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年のことを考えると、ワクワクするのと同時に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりちょっと不安もあります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/icon/sweat01.gif"